    "notes": "Inspected48 current portable/shared/medium-fi/native frames and full-resolution native stair, undercroft, platform entry and roof-bearing views during one author/inspect/fix pass. Four exposed timber posts support the open square platform, steep nine-tread stair, two stringers/handrails, vertical balusters and shallow green pyramidal roof. The underside stays open; there is a real gap in the front rail for the stair. An inner bearing ring seats the roof on the posts and near-level hip rafters follow its pitch. No unrelated tree/canopy is baked into the structure."
